    <mxCell id="p1_ext_list" value="🧠 Google Gemini 2.5 Flash Lite (AI)&#xa;🎥 Jitsi Meet – meet.jit.si (Video)&#xa;🎙️ Web Speech API (Free STT)&#xa;☁️ Google Cloud Run (Hosting)&#xa;🏗️ Cloud Build + Artifact Registry&#xa;🗺️ Google Maps (Facility Finder)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
